{"Title":"An Act relative to eliminating liability limits for abuse of a minor\r\n\r\n","BillNumber":"H1446","DocketNumber":"HD3979","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"MSD1","Name":"Michael S. Day","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MSD1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T15:52:42.817"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"MSD1","Name":"Michael S. Day","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MSD1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T15:52:42.8166667"},{"Id":"S_M1","Name":"Samantha Montaño","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/S_M1","ResponseDate":"2023-07-10T17:25:38.2933333"},{"Id":"JPL1","Name":"Jack Patrick Lewis","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JPL1","ResponseDate":"2023-07-10T17:25:38.2933333"},{"Id":"L_S1","Name":"Lindsay N. Sabadosa","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/L_S1","ResponseDate":"2024-01-29T16:54:27.4566667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H1446/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Day of Stoneham, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 1446) of Michael S. Day relative to eliminating liability limits for abuse of minors.  The Judiciary.","DocumentText":"\t Section 85K of chapter 231 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2018 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting a new paragraph at the end as follows:\r\n\t“The liability limitations set forth in this section shall not apply to any entity in a civil action for sexual abuse of a minor, as that term is defined in section 4C1/2 of chapter 260, or a civil action for physical abuse of a minor.”\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J19","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J19"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}